  text: "THESE 5 REPOS BUILD THE $35K-STUDIO MOTION SITE - ON HIGGSFIELD + CLAUDE\
    \ CODE.\n\nCLAUDEDESIGNSKILLS (152★) by freshtechbro · MIT\n\nthe most-adopted\
    \ web-dev skill pack for Claude Code.\n\nwhat it adds:\n\n→ skills for Three.js,\
    \ GSAP, React Three Fiber, Motion, Babylon\n→ scroll-animation + interactive-experience\
    \ patterns baked in\n→ turns Claude Code into a design-grade front-end builder\n\
    → drop into ~/.claude/skills/ and go\nthe workhorse of the list - start here.\n\
    \nGSAP-SKILLS (8★) by greensock - official · MIT\n\nlow stars, highest trust:\
    \ it's from the makers of GSAP.\n\nwhat it adds:\n\n→ gsap-scrolltrigger: scroll-linked\
    \ animation, pinning, scrub\n→ timeline, plugins, react, performance skills\n\
    → teaches the agent correct GSAP instead of hallucinated APIs\n→ install: npx\
    \ skills add https://t.co/BFjCkptsos\n\nstop letting the model guess spring values.\n\
    \nMOTION-DEV-ANIMATIONS-SKILL (20★) by 199-biotechnologies · MIT\n\nthe polish\
    \ layer - https://t.co/SDjzA1cu3C (Framer Motion's successor).\n\nwhat it adds:\n\
    \n→ hero fade-up, scroll reveal, parallax, magnetic-button patterns\n→ 120fps\
    \ GPU-accelerated, transform/opacity only - zero layout shift\n→ prefers-reduced-motion\
    \ + keyboard support baked in\n→ progressive loading: ~2K-token core, examples\
    \ load on demand\n\nthis is what makes a site feel premium.\n\nHIGGSFIELD-SKILL\
    \ (3★) by robonuggets · CC BY 4.0\n\nthe connector that wires Higgsfield's models\
    \ into Claude Code.\n\nwhat it adds:\n\n→ one auth, 30+ models - Seedance 2.0,\
    \ Sora 2, Veo, Kling, Soul, Cinema\n→ surfaces credit cost + a cost-approval gate\
    \ before paid runs\n→ install: claude mcp add --transport http --scope user higgsfield\
    \ https://t.co/ccj3bJ8Bcy\n\nthe cleanest way to plug in the assets.\n\nCLAUDE-SEEDANCE-SKILL\
    \ (2★) by liamrjohnston30\ndrives Higgsfield Seedance 2.0 to render your hero/background\
    \ video.\n\nwhat it adds:\n\n→ Playwright automation in a real Chrome window -\
    \ image → video, on-camera\n→ five-slot prompt architecture (subject, action,\
    \ camera, lighting, style)\n→ persistent login, step screenshots, output URLs\n\
    → built as the pipeline for the Higgsfield × Claude video\n\nfeed its output straight\
    \ into the scroll site.\n\nBONUS - the official one:\n\nMOTION WEBSITE GENERATOR\
    \ skill by Higgsfield. \n\nBrand kit in → scroll-driven motion site out; chains\
    \ the MCP + Vibe Motion and auto-applies 6 cinematic effects (film grain, particles,\
    \ vignette, glass cards, color tints, scroll pacing). \n\nIf you install nothing\
    \ else, install this.\n\nthe stack in one line:\n\nhiggsfield-skill + claude-seedance-skill\
    \ pull the assets → claudedesignskills + GSAP + https://t.co/SDjzA1cu3C assemble\
    \ the scroll site → you ship the $35K-studio look in a weekend.\n\nwhich of these\
    \ are you running?\n\nFULL $35K MOTION-WEBSITE PLAYBOOK \U0001F447"
